{
  "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
  "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
  "records": [
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0000-0000",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 1,
        "start": 1
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The above-entitled matter came on for oral argument before the Supreme Court of the United States at 11:10 a.m."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0000-0001",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 3,
        "start": 3
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "requiring the release of between 36,000 and 45,000 inmates, currently incarcerated in the California penal system, within a 2-year period."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0000-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 4,
        "start": 4
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE GINSBURG: One case, Mr. Phillips, is pending for 20 years; is that not so?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Ginsburg",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0001-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 31,
        "start": 31
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Justice GINSBURG: Can you explain me something about that?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0001-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 37,
        "start": 37
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Justice SOTOMAYOR: Are you talking about current figures or past? Tell us the date of the figures."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0001-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 38,
        "start": 38
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "Justice SCALIA: What was -- what was your friend talking about when he said that they rejected any effort to show the current situation?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0004",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 40,
        "start": 40
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. SPECTER: The remedy -- well, the final\norder came -- well, the close of evidence was in\ndecember of 2008."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0005",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 40,
        "start": 40
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. SPECTER: The trial closed in December\nof 2008, after all the parties had submitted all their\nevidence."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kennedy",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 41,
        "start": 41
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KENNEDY: What about the argument\nthat there was evidence that should have been admitted\nbut that was not, with reference to new construction?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Specter",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0006",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 41,
        "start": 41
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. SPECTER: Well, I -- I agree with my\nfriend Mr. Phillips that the population has declined by\nabout 10,000 prisoners."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Alito",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 42,
        "start": 42
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE ALITO: Can you explain what the\nconnection is between the 137.5 percent figure\nand the constitutional violations relating to the provision of\nmedical care in general and treatment for -- for mental\nillness?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Specter",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0007",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 48,
        "start": 48
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "The Secretary of the Department of\nCorrections who was the secretary at the time of trial\nso testified that he was in favor, for example, of\nincreasing prisoners' good time credits. That's one way\nto reduce crowding."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 49,
        "start": 49
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "CHIEF JUSTICE ROBERTS: But that's not what\n-- that is not what the three-judge district court\ndetermined. The Prisoner Litigation Reform Act requires\nthat court to give substantial weight to adverse impact\non public safety."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0002-0002",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 54,
        "start": 54
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SCALIA: What -- doesn't good time\ncredits let -- let people out who would not otherwise be\nout?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Court",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0003-0004",
      "kind": "procedural_event",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 65,
        "start": 64
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "This order is set to take effect over a 2-year period, and during that 2-year period, if Mr. Phillips is correct that the conditions are constitutional and that they can deliver services at 145 percent, then the State is free to come in and make a motion to -- to bring those changed circumstances to the court."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0004-0000",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 77,
        "start": 77
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAGAN: Mr. Phillips, sorry, but on a -- on a different subject. Does the State stand by its representation that it can do this without any public safety impact in 5 years?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0004-0001",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 77,
        "start": 77
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: I don't know what the declaration said. Is the actual declaration in the record somewhere?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Phillips",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0004-0002",
      "kind": "party_argument",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 77,
        "start": 77
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. PHILLIPS: Yes. I mean, we made that submission to the court, and we -- we believe that we could comply with it."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Kagan",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0004-0003",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 78,
        "start": 78
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE KAGAN: -- economic differences, budget differences?"
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Phillips",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0004-0004",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 78,
        "start": 78
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. PHILLIPS: Look, I mean, the plaintiffs' counsel talks about all of the things that you can do, and if you -- if you look at 70a of the -- the jurisdictional statement appendix, it specifically says there's a line; above the line we can implement, and that will get you about 16,000 inmates, and below the line you need legislation in order to implement these things."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Justice Sotomayor",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0004-0005",
      "kind": "justice_question",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 79,
        "start": 79
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "JUSTICE SOTOMAYOR: So why didn't you give the court that as your plan? The court gave you absolute discretion to implement the plan that you wanted; it said we don't want to do facility by facility, because we want you to figure out where you need to implement."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Mr. Phillips",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 1.0,
      "document_hash": "5f13bcfb0fbb58a2489b83ad89ac6e09cc4d8771e978e178b9380d601e20009b",
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f13bcfb0fbb-0004-0006",
      "kind": "fact",
      "opinion_part": null,
      "pages": {
        "end": 80,
        "start": 80
      },
      "schema_version": "1.0.0",
      "status": "supported",
      "text": "MR. PHILLIPS: Because the district court's order said you're going to have to reach 137.5 percent in 2 years, period."
    },
    {
      "attribution": "Source extraction",
      "case_id": "2010-09-1233",
      "confidence": 0.0,
